This source code, the "Vroomi" character design and all related materials are provided to the
organizers and judges of the Hyundai Motor Group Vehicle App Development Contest solely for
evaluation, demonstration and exhibition purposes as described in the contest rules.
No other license is granted. Third-party components remain under their own licenses
(see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md).

Why not an open-source license:
The contest rules keep the intellectual property of an entry with the entrant, while giving the
organizer a non-exclusive license option and a 4-month priority negotiation right for winning
entries. A permissive open-source license (e.g. Apache-2.0 or MIT) would grant the same rights to
everyone and undermine both the team's ownership of the Vroomi character IP and that negotiation.
The team can relicense later if it decides to open-source the project.
